OL,3,GNEWSARail disaster of 1957 marked by St
OL,4,AJohn's plaque
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plaque is to be unveiled at a
OL,7,Fceremony at 12:00 BST on Saturday,
OL,8,Fwhich will also include speeches, a
OL,9,Flocal choir, readings and music.
